SUMMARY:[Healthcare & Clinical AI][Time Series & Sequential Data] SD4H 2026
  (formerly TS4H) - Workshop paper submission deadline (4 pages\, non-arch
 ival)
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: Structured Data for Health Workshop\nWebsite:
  https://structureddata4health.github.io/\nSource URL: https://structured
 data4health.github.io/call_for_papers.html\nLocation: Seoul\, South Korea
 \nTopics: Healthcare & Clinical AI\, Time Series & Sequential Data\, Sign
 al Processing\, Deep Representation Learning\nSize: S\nSubmission type: W
 orkshop / non-archival short paper\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked d
 ate: 2026-10-29\nNotes: ICML's official workshop page and the SD4H site c
 onfirm Sat Jul 11\, 2026 in Hall D2\, COEX\, Seoul (ICML lists 8:00-17:00
  KST)\; accepted papers had to be presented in person and the workshop is
  non-archival (no proceedings). The site's Prior Years menu links TS4H's 
 NeurIPS 2025\, ICLR 2024 and NeurIPS 2022 pages and organizers overlap\, 
 but no formal rename is stated\; it is tracked under the TS4H key by owne
 r decision. 4-page papers were due May 2 AoE after an extension (OpenRevi
 ew's venue page and submission invitation instead record May 1 12:00 UTC)
 \; camera-ready was Jun 26 AoE. As of 2026-10-29 no later SD4H or TS4H ed
 ition is announced.
URL:https://structureddata4health.github.io/call_for_papers.html
END:VEVENT
